---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About" description="Meet the person behind NEXWEALTH — licensed, verified, and here to help you plan your finances.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gold mb-3">About</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-indigo mb-6">Hi, I'm Muhammed Zuhair.</h1>

    <p class="text-ink/70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      I built NEXWEALTH because most people don't need another sales pitch —
      they need someone to explain, plainly, what a SIP actually does, whether
      an FD still beats inflation, and how to compare a fund without falling
      for last year's chart. That's what this site is for.
    </p>

    <p class="text-ink/70 leading-relaxed mb-10">
      Alongside the free tools here, I'm also an Authorised Person with NSE
      (via Sharekhan) and a licensed Point of Sales Person with Turtlemint for
      both life and general insurance — so if you'd rather talk to someone
      directly about opening a demat account or starting an investment, I can
      help with that too. You can also view my
      <a href="https://advisor.turtlemintinsurance.com/profile/MUH4331373/muhammed_zuhair_nalakath" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo underline">Turtlemint advisor profile</a> directly.
    </p>

    <!-- Trust / verification -->
    <div class="border border-line rounded-2xl p-8 mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-indigo mb-4">Licenses &amp; verification</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-gain mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span><strong>NSE Authorised Person</strong> (Cash Market segment) — registered via Sharekhan Ltd., Registration Code AP2069593051.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-gain mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span><strong>Turtlemint POSP — Life Insurance</strong>, certified under IRDAI Point of Sales Person guidelines.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-gain mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span><strong>Turtlemint POSP — General &amp; Health Insurance</strong>, certified under IRDAI Point of Sales Person guidelines.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-xs text-ink/45 mt-6">
        Certificates available on request. Personal identification numbers and
        addresses on original documents are redacted for privacy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="border border-line rounded-2xl p-8 bg-indigo/5">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-indigo mb-3">Want to open an account or start investing?</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 mb-5">
        I can guide you through opening a demat &amp; trading account with
        Sharekhan, or help you compare and buy insurance through Turtlemint.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://diy.sharekhan.com/app/Account/RegisterFOS?grpcd=13977&type=pb&grpid=14427&utm_empcode=PB13977USER&FormType=CDSL&CustomerType=FOS"
          target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="bg-indigo text-paper px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-indigoLight transition-colors"
        >
          Open a Sharekhan account
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:md_zuhair.owner@bp.sharekhan.com"
          class="border border-line px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:border-indigo transition-colors"
        >
          Email me directly
        </a>
        <a href="/contact"
          class="border border-line px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:border-indigo transition-colors"
        >
          Or use the contact form
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
